`- **<Mechanism, as a general sentence>.** <What happened here, with numbers>. <Fix>. (<guarding test or tool>)`

- Append-only. Write the trap in the session that hit it, under a dated heading.
- Mark a repeat "(again)"; never delete either entry.
- **A trap that bites twice gets promoted** into a lint, a script check, a template line or a
